{"seq":1,"slug":"shiny-interactive-apps","title":"Shiny 交互式应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/applications/shiny-interactive-apps","wordCount":867,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"shiny-交互式应用\">Shiny 交互式应用</h1><p>Shiny 让 R 程序员无需 JavaScript、HTML 或 CSS 知识即可构建功能完整的 Web 应用。其核心抽象是响应式编程——UI 输入变化时自动触发相关计算和输出更新，无需手动管理状态同步。从探索性数据分析仪表盘到生产级临床试验报告系统，Shiny 覆盖了从原型到部署的完整生命周期。Posit Connect 提供了企业级部署基础设施。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>响应式编程是 Shiny 的核心抽象</strong>：输入变化自动触发下游重算，开发者不手动同步状态。</li>\n<li><strong>三个原语构成依赖图</strong>：reactive source（<code>input$*</code>）通知、reactive conductor（<code>reactive({})</code>）缓存、reactive endpoint（<code>observe</code>/<code>output$*</code>）执行副作用。</li>\n<li><strong><code>reactive()</code> 缓存计算结果</strong>，只在依赖变化时失效，是避免重复昂贵计算的关键。</li>\n<li><strong><code>isolate()</code> 打断依赖链</strong>，让输出只在需要时读取其他输入。</li>\n<li><strong>模块用命名空间解决大型应用的复用与污染问题</strong>，UI 与 Server 成对定义。</li>\n<li><strong>性能瓶颈通常是触发频率而非计算量</strong>：<code>debounce()</code>/<code>throttle()</code> 与 <code>bindCache()</code> 是最直接的杠杆。</li>\n<li><strong>部署形态决定扩展能力</strong>：从单进程的 Shiny Server 到容器化的 ShinyProxy 与托管的 Posit Connect。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"响应式编程模型\">响应式编程模型</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[输入 reactive source] --&gt; B[响应式表达式 reactive]&#10;    B --&gt; C[输出 observer/output]&#10;    A --&gt; C&#10;    B --&gt; D[另一个 reactive]&#10;    D --&gt; C&#10;    A -.-&gt;|&quot;自动依赖追踪&quot;| B&#10;    B -.-&gt;|&quot;自动失效传播&quot;| C\">graph LR\n    A[输入 reactive source] --&gt; B[响应式表达式 reactive]\n    B --&gt; C[输出 observer/output]\n    A --&gt; C\n    B --&gt; D[另一个 reactive]\n    D --&gt; C\n    A -.-&gt;|\"自动依赖追踪\"| B\n    B -.-&gt;|\"自动失效传播\"| C</pre><p>Shiny 的响应式系统基于三个核心原语：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原语</th>\n<th>创建方式</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Reactive source</td>\n<td><code>input$*</code>、<code>reactiveVal()</code></td>\n<td>值变化时通知下游</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reactive conductor</td>\n<td><code>reactive({...})</code></td>\n<td>缓存计算结果，按需失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reactive endpoint</td>\n<td><code>observe({...})</code>、<code>output$*</code></td>\n<td>执行副作用或渲染输出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"最小-shiny-应用\">最小 Shiny 应用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(shiny)&#10;&#10;ui &lt;- fluidPage(&#10;  titlePanel(&quot;企鹅数据探索&quot;),&#10;  sidebarLayout(&#10;    sidebarPanel(&#10;      selectInput(&quot;species&quot;, &quot;选择物种&quot;,&#10;                  choices = c(&quot;全部&quot;, &quot;Adelie&quot;, &quot;Chinstrap&quot;, &quot;Gentoo&quot;)),&#10;      sliderInput(&quot;mass_range&quot;, &quot;体重范围 (g)&quot;,&#10;                  min = 2500, max = 6500, value = c(2500, 6500))&#10;    ),&#10;    mainPanel(&#10;      plotOutput(&quot;scatter_plot&quot;),&#10;      tableOutput(&quot;summary_table&quot;)&#10;    )&#10;  )&#10;)&#10;&#10;server &lt;- function(input, output, session) {&#10;  filtered_data &lt;- reactive({&#10;    data &lt;- penguins&#10;    if (input$species != &quot;全部&quot;) {&#10;      data &lt;- data |&gt; filter(species == input$species)&#10;    }&#10;    data |&gt; filter(between(body_mass_g, input$mass_range[1], input$mass_range[2]))&#10;  })&#10;&#10;  output$scatter_plot &lt;- renderPlot({&#10;    ggplot(filtered_data(), aes(x = bill_length_mm, y = bill_depth_mm, color = species)) +&#10;      geom_point(size = 2, alpha = 0.7) +&#10;      theme_minimal()&#10;  })&#10;&#10;  output$summary_table &lt;- renderTable({&#10;    filtered_data() |&gt;&#10;      group_by(species) |&gt;&#10;      summarise(n = n(), mean_mass = mean(body_mass_g, na.rm = TRUE))&#10;  })&#10;}&#10;&#10;shinyApp(ui, server)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(shiny)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ui &#x3C;- fluidPage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  titlePanel(\"企鹅数据探索\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sidebarLayout(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sidebarPanel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      selectInput(\"species\", \"选择物种\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  choices = c(\"全部\", \"Adelie\", \"Chinstrap\", \"Gentoo\")),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      sliderInput(\"mass_range\", \"体重范围 (g)\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  min = 2500, max = 6500, value = c(2500, 6500))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mainPanel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      plotOutput(\"scatter_plot\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      tableOutput(\"summary_table\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server &#x3C;- function(input, output, session) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filtered_data &#x3C;- reactive({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data &#x3C;- penguins</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (input$species != \"全部\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      data &#x3C;- data |> filter(species == input$species)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data |> filter(between(body_mass_g, input$mass_range[1], input$mass_range[2]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  output$scatter_plot &#x3C;- renderPlot({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ggplot(filtered_data(), aes(x = bill_length_mm, y = bill_depth_mm, color = species)) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      geom_point(size = 2, alpha = 0.7) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      theme_minimal()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  output$summary_table &#x3C;- renderTable({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    filtered_data() |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      group_by(species) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      summarise(n = n(), mean_mass = mean(body_mass_g, na.rm = TRUE))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>shinyApp(ui, server)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"响应式工具箱\">响应式工具箱</h2><h3 id=\"reactive-缓存计算\"><code>reactive()</code> — 缓存计算</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 只在依赖变化时重新计算&#10;expensive_result &lt;- reactive({&#10;  # 耗时操作：数据库查询、模型拟合&#10;  db_query(input$date_range, input$region)&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 只在依赖变化时重新计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expensive_result &#x3C;- reactive({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 耗时操作：数据库查询、模型拟合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  db_query(input$date_range, input$region)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"reactiveval-reactivevalues-可变状态\"><code>reactiveVal()</code> / <code>reactiveValues()</code> — 可变状态</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 单值响应式变量&#10;counter &lt;- reactiveVal(0)&#10;observeEvent(input$increment, {&#10;  counter(counter() + 1)&#10;})&#10;&#10;# 多值响应式存储&#10;state &lt;- reactiveValues(data = NULL, model = NULL, status = &quot;idle&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 单值响应式变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>counter &#x3C;- reactiveVal(0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>observeEvent(input$increment, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  counter(counter() + 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 多值响应式存储</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state &#x3C;- reactiveValues(data = NULL, model = NULL, status = \"idle\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"observeevent-事件驱动副作用\"><code>observeEvent()</code> — 事件驱动副作用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"observeEvent(input$run_model, {&#10;  # 按钮点击时执行&#10;  showNotification(&quot;开始拟合模型...&quot;, type = &quot;message&quot;)&#10;  state$model &lt;- lm(y ~ x, data = state$data)&#10;  showNotification(&quot;模型拟合完成&quot;, type = &quot;message&quot;)&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>observeEvent(input$run_model, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 按钮点击时执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  showNotification(\"开始拟合模型...\", type = \"message\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  state$model &#x3C;- lm(y ~ x, data = state$data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  showNotification(\"模型拟合完成\", type = \"message\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"isolate-打断依赖链\"><code>isolate()</code> — 打断依赖链</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"output$report &lt;- renderText({&#10;  # 只在按钮点击时更新，不响应 input$text 的变化&#10;  input$generate  # 触发依赖&#10;  isolate({&#10;    paste(&quot;报告内容:&quot;, input$text)&#10;  })&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>output$report &#x3C;- renderText({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 只在按钮点击时更新，不响应 input$text 的变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  input$generate  # 触发依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  isolate({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    paste(\"报告内容:\", input$text)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ui-组件库\">UI 组件库</h2><h3 id=\"输入组件\">输入组件</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 数值&#10;numericInput(&quot;n&quot;, &quot;样本量&quot;, value = 100, min = 10, max = 10000)&#10;sliderInput(&quot;alpha&quot;, &quot;显著性水平&quot;, min = 0.01, max = 0.10, value = 0.05)&#10;&#10;# 选择&#10;selectInput(&quot;method&quot;, &quot;方法&quot;, choices = c(&quot;lm&quot;, &quot;glm&quot;, &quot;gam&quot;))&#10;radioButtons(&quot;dist&quot;, &quot;分布&quot;, choices = c(&quot;正态&quot;, &quot;泊松&quot;, &quot;二项&quot;))&#10;checkboxGroupInput(&quot;vars&quot;, &quot;变量&quot;, choices = names(df))&#10;&#10;# 文件&#10;fileInput(&quot;upload&quot;, &quot;上传数据&quot;, accept = &quot;.csv&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 日期&#10;dateRangeInput(&quot;dates&quot;, &quot;日期范围&quot;, start = &quot;2024-01-01&quot;, end = &quot;2026-01-01&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 数值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>numericInput(\"n\", \"样本量\", value = 100, min = 10, max = 10000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sliderInput(\"alpha\", \"显著性水平\", min = 0.01, max = 0.10, value = 0.05)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>selectInput(\"method\", \"方法\", choices = c(\"lm\", \"glm\", \"gam\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>radioButtons(\"dist\", \"分布\", choices = c(\"正态\", \"泊松\", \"二项\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>checkboxGroupInput(\"vars\", \"变量\", choices = names(df))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fileInput(\"upload\", \"上传数据\", accept = \".csv\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 日期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dateRangeInput(\"dates\", \"日期范围\", start = \"2024-01-01\", end = \"2026-01-01\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"输出组件\">输出组件</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 图形&#10;plotOutput(&quot;plot&quot;, height = &quot;400px&quot;, click = &quot;plot_click&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 表格&#10;DT::dataTableOutput(&quot;table&quot;)     # 交互式表格&#10;tableOutput(&quot;static_table&quot;)       # 静态表格&#10;&#10;# 文本&#10;verbatimTextOutput(&quot;model_summary&quot;)  # 等宽字体&#10;htmlOutput(&quot;formatted_text&quot;)          # HTML 渲染&#10;&#10;# 下载&#10;downloadButton(&quot;download_report&quot;, &quot;下载报告&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 图形</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plotOutput(\"plot\", height = \"400px\", click = \"plot_click\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 表格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>DT::dataTableOutput(\"table\")     # 交互式表格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tableOutput(\"static_table\")       # 静态表格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 文本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>verbatimTextOutput(\"model_summary\")  # 等宽字体</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>htmlOutput(\"formatted_text\")          # HTML 渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 下载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>downloadButton(\"download_report\", \"下载报告\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"模块化-modules\">模块化（Modules）</h2><p>Shiny 模块解决了大型应用的命名空间污染和代码复用问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 模块 UI 函数&#10;histogramUI &lt;- function(id) {&#10;  ns &lt;- NS(id)&#10;  tagList(&#10;    selectInput(ns(&quot;var&quot;), &quot;变量&quot;, choices = NULL),&#10;    sliderInput(ns(&quot;bins&quot;), &quot;分箱数&quot;, min = 5, max = 50, value = 20),&#10;    plotOutput(ns(&quot;plot&quot;))&#10;  )&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 模块 Server 函数&#10;histogramServer &lt;- function(id, data) {&#10;  moduleServer(id, function(input, output, session) {&#10;    observe({&#10;      updateSelectInput(session, &quot;var&quot;,&#10;                        choices = names(data() |&gt; select(where(is.numeric))))&#10;    })&#10;&#10;    output$plot &lt;- renderPlot({&#10;      req(input$var)&#10;      ggplot(data(), aes(x = .data[[input$var]])) +&#10;        geom_histogram(bins = input$bins, fill = &quot;steelblue&quot;, alpha = 0.7) +&#10;        theme_minimal()&#10;    })&#10;  })&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 在主应用中复用&#10;ui &lt;- fluidPage(&#10;  histogramUI(&quot;hist1&quot;),&#10;  histogramUI(&quot;hist2&quot;)&#10;)&#10;&#10;server &lt;- function(input, output, session) {&#10;  data &lt;- reactive(penguins)&#10;  histogramServer(&quot;hist1&quot;, data)&#10;  histogramServer(&quot;hist2&quot;, data)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 模块 UI 函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>histogramUI &#x3C;- function(id) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ns &#x3C;- NS(id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tagList(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    selectInput(ns(\"var\"), \"变量\", choices = NULL),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sliderInput(ns(\"bins\"), \"分箱数\", min = 5, max = 50, value = 20),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    plotOutput(ns(\"plot\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 模块 Server 函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>histogramServer &#x3C;- function(id, data) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  moduleServer(id, function(input, output, session) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    observe({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      updateSelectInput(session, \"var\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        choices = names(data() |> select(where(is.numeric))))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    output$plot &#x3C;- renderPlot({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      req(input$var)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ggplot(data(), aes(x = .data[[input$var]])) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        geom_histogram(bins = input$bins, fill = \"steelblue\", alpha = 0.7) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        theme_minimal()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 在主应用中复用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ui &#x3C;- fluidPage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  histogramUI(\"hist1\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  histogramUI(\"hist2\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server &#x3C;- function(input, output, session) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data &#x3C;- reactive(penguins)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  histogramServer(\"hist1\", data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  histogramServer(\"hist2\", data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"性能优化\">性能优化</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>响应过于频繁</td>\n<td><code>debounce()</code> / <code>throttle()</code></td>\n<td>减少触发频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复计算</td>\n<td><code>bindCache()</code></td>\n<td>缓存相同输入的结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大数据渲染慢</td>\n<td><code>renderCachedPlot()</code></td>\n<td>图形缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>初始加载慢</td>\n<td>延迟加载 / <code>shinycssloaders</code></td>\n<td>用户感知改善</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长时间计算</td>\n<td><code>ExtendedTask</code> / promises</td>\n<td>异步执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 缓存响应式计算&#10;filtered &lt;- reactive({&#10;  df |&gt; filter(region == input$region, year == input$year)&#10;}) |&gt; bindCache(input$region, input$year)&#10;&#10;# 异步长时间操作&#10;output$result &lt;- renderText({&#10;  future_promise({&#10;    # 在后台线程运行&#10;    Sys.sleep(5)&#10;    heavy_computation()&#10;  })&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 缓存响应式计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>filtered &#x3C;- reactive({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  df |> filter(region == input$region, year == input$year)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}) |> bindCache(input$region, input$year)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 异步长时间操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>output$result &#x3C;- renderText({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  future_promise({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 在后台线程运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Sys.sleep(5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    heavy_computation()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"部署选项\">部署选项</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 本地运行&#10;shiny::runApp(&quot;app/&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 部署到 shinyapps.io（Posit 托管）&#10;rsconnect::deployApp(&quot;app/&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 部署到 Posit Connect（企业级）&#10;rsconnect::deployApp(&quot;app/&quot;, server = &quot;connect.company.com&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 本地运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>shiny::runApp(\"app/\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 部署到 shinyapps.io（Posit 托管）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rsconnect::deployApp(\"app/\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 部署到 Posit Connect（企业级）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rsconnect::deployApp(\"app/\", server = \"connect.company.com\")</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>认证</th>\n<th>扩展性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>shinyapps.io</td>\n<td>个人/小团队</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Posit Connect</td>\n<td>企业</td>\n<td>LDAP/SAML/OAuth</td>\n<td>水平扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ShinyProxy</td>\n<td>自托管</td>\n<td>Docker 隔离</td>\n<td>按需启动容器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shiny Server Open Source</td>\n<td>自托管</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>单进程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与报告系统集成\">与报告系统集成</h2><p>Shiny 应用的分析结果常需要导出为静态报告——通过参数化 Quarto/R Markdown 文档实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"output$download_report &lt;- downloadHandler(&#10;  filename = &quot;report.pdf&quot;,&#10;  content = function(file) {&#10;    params &lt;- list(&#10;      species = input$species,&#10;      date_range = input$dates&#10;    )&#10;    quarto::quarto_render(&quot;report.qmd&quot;, output_file = file,&#10;                          execute_params = params)&#10;  }&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>output$download_report &#x3C;- downloadHandler(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filename = \"report.pdf\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  content = function(file) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    params &#x3C;- list(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      species = input$species,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      date_range = input$dates</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    quarto::quarto_render(\"report.qmd\", output_file = file,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                          execute_params = params)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关于 Quarto 报告系统的完整介绍，参见<a href=\"rmarkdown-quarto\">R Markdown 与 Quarto 报告</a>。Shiny 内部的数据操作通常使用<a href=\"../tidyverse/dplyr-data-manipulation\">dplyr 数据操作</a>中的管道模式，而可视化输出则依赖 ggplot2。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Shiny 的价值在于把响应式状态管理自动化，用 R 就能构建完整的 Web 应用。</li>\n<li>三个原语的职责边界清晰：source 通知变化、conductor 缓存计算、endpoint 执行副作用，把计算放进 <code>reactive()</code> 是性能优化的第一步。</li>\n<li><code>reactiveVal()</code>/<code>reactiveValues()</code> 提供可变状态，<code>observeEvent()</code> 承载事件驱动的副作用。</li>\n<li>模块化是大型 Shiny 应用的必经之路，<code>NS()</code> 命名空间避免了 ID 冲突。</li>\n<li>性能优化先看触发频率（debounce/throttle），再看重复计算（bindCache），最后才考虑异步（ExtendedTask/promises）。</li>\n<li>部署选项从个人级到企业级跨度很大，认证方式与扩展模型是选择时的决定性因素。</li>\n<li>Shiny 与参数化 Quarto 报告互补：前者提供实时交互，后者提供可归档的静态产物。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Shiny 交互式应用","id":"shiny-交互式应用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"响应式编程模型","id":"响应式编程模型"},{"level":3,"text":"最小 Shiny 应用","id":"最小-shiny-应用"},{"level":2,"text":"响应式工具箱","id":"响应式工具箱"},{"level":3,"text":"`reactive()` — 缓存计算","id":"reactive-缓存计算"},{"level":3,"text":"`reactiveVal()` / `reactiveValues()` — 可变状态","id":"reactiveval-reactivevalues-可变状态"},{"level":3,"text":"`observeEvent()` — 事件驱动副作用","id":"observeevent-事件驱动副作用"},{"level":3,"text":"`isolate()` — 打断依赖链","id":"isolate-打断依赖链"},{"level":2,"text":"UI 组件库","id":"ui-组件库"},{"level":3,"text":"输入组件","id":"输入组件"},{"level":3,"text":"输出组件","id":"输出组件"},{"level":2,"text":"模块化（Modules）","id":"模块化-modules"},{"level":2,"text":"性能优化","id":"性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"部署选项","id":"部署选项"},{"level":2,"text":"与报告系统集成","id":"与报告系统集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生存分析与临床统计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/statistical-computing/survival-analysis-r"},"next":{"title":"R Markdown 与 Quarto 报告","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/applications/rmarkdown-quarto"}}